        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Academic Personnel Stewardship</h2>
        <p>
            Build a comprehensive digital dossier for every educator and support staff member. 
            The Staff module manages personal profiles, employment contracts, and 
            digital archival of academic qualifications—essential for ministry audit 
            compliance. Detailed tracking of teacher-subject assignments provides 
            academic leadership with immediate visibility of instructional load and 
            qualification alignment across the school's curriculum.
        </p>
        <p>
            The system also manages staff leave—Annual, Sick, Maternity, and Study 
            leave—ensuring that the school's instructional capacity is maintained 
            with minimal disruption.
        </p>
    </div>
