<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">ZIMRA & Statutory Payroll Compliance</h2>
        <p>
            Automate the complexity of educational payroll. The system computes monthly 
            salaries including basic pay, allowances (e.g., housing, transport), and 
            overtime, while hard-wiring all statutory deductions per Zimbabwean law—inclusive 
            of PAYE, NSSA, ZIMDEF, and the AIDS Levy. Branded PDF payslips are generated 
            automatically, and the system produces the required P2 forms and NSSA monthly 
            returns, significantly reducing the administrative burden on the school's 
            finance office.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated bulk bank upload file generation ensures that salary payments are 
            executed with absolute precision and speed, maintaining high staff 
            morale and institutional credibility.
        </p>
    </div>
